    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a strict LinkedIn editor. Your job is to improve the draft, not simply repeat it.\n\nOriginal draft:\n{{ $json.output }}\n\nReview the draft for:\n1. A compelling opening hook.\n2. Clear, concise, natural language.\n3. Useful and specific advice.\n4. A strong call to action.\n5. Repetitive phrases, vague claims, and unnecessary words.\n\nRewrite the post to make meaningful improvements. Change weak sentences, remove repetition, and make the content more engaging. Preserve the original topic, but do not copy the draft sentence by sentence.\n\nRequirements:\n- 120–150 words.\n- Professional, conversational tone.\n- Maximum 3 hashtags.\n- Do not invent facts or statistics.\n- Return only the final revised post. Do not include scores or explanations.",
        "options": {}
      },
